# Credentials. `.env.example` is the one that is committed.
.env

# The volume compose mounts at /config: go2rtc.yaml is regenerated at every
# start, and go2rtc.overlay.yaml belongs to whoever deployed it. The directory
# itself is tracked, because Container Manager refuses a project whose bind
# mount source does not exist.
config/*
!config/.gitkeep
